    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in a quiet cul-de-sac within the sought-after Glenview development, No. 7 is an exceptional four-bedroom detached family home presented in pristine, turnkey condition. Offering spacious, light-filled accommodation and a superb south-facing rear garden, this impressive property is perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe well-designed interior comprises a welcoming entrance hall, elegant reception rooms and a contemporary kitchen/dining area that forms the heart of the home, providing an ideal space for everyday living and entertaining with office and sunroom to the rear. Upstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms, including two with en-suite bathrooms, together with a stylish family bathroom and a convenient guest WC, bringing the total to four bathrooms.\r\n\r\nA particular highlight of this outstanding home is the beautifully maintained south-facing rear garden, which enjoys sunshine throughout the day and provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing. To the front, the property benefits from private parking and enjoys the peace and privacy afforded by its quiet cul-de-sac setting.\r\n\r\nGlenview is ideally located within easy reach of Stamullen Village, where a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés and sporting facilities are readily available. The nearby M1 motorway provides excellent connectivity to Dublin City, Dublin Airport and Drogheda, making this an ideal location for commuters seeking the perfect balance of village living and convenience.\r\n\r\nCombining generous family accommodation, immaculate presentation and an enviable south-facing aspect, No. 7 Glenview represents a superb opportunity to acquire a truly turnkey detached home in one of Stamullen's most desirable residential developments. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
